    </svg>

  {%- when 'llama' -%}
    <svg class="cauce-icono {{ cauce_clase }}" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <path d="M12 21.4a6.4 6.4 0 0 1-6.4-6.4c0-3.6 2.6-5.6 3.6-9 1.9 1.3 2.8 3.2 2.8 5 1.2-.6 2-1.9 2.2-3.5 2.4 2 4.2 4.8 4.2 7.5a6.4 6.4 0 0 1-6.4 6.4Z"/>
      <path d="M12 21.4a2.6 2.6 0 0 1-2.6-2.6c0-1.6 1.4-2.6 2.6-4.2 1.2 1.6 2.6 2.6 2.6 4.2a2.6 2.6 0 0 1-2.6 2.6Z"/>
    </svg>

  {%- when 'ola' -%}
    <svg class="cauce-icono {{ cauce_clase }}" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <path d="M2.6 8.2c2.3-2 4.7-2 7 0s4.7 2 7 0 4.2-1.6 4.8-1.2M2.6 13c2.3-2 4.7-2 7 0s4.7 2 7 0 4.2-1.6 4.8-1.2M2.6 17.8c2.3-2 4.7-2 7 0s4.7 2 7 0 4.2-1.6 4.8-1.2"/>
    </svg>

  {%- when 'infinito' -%}
    <svg class="cauce-icono {{ cauce_clase }}" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <path d="M12 12c-2-2.67-4-4-6-4a4 4 0 1 0 0 8c2 0 4-1.33 6-4Zm0 0c2 2.67 4 4 6 4a4 4 0 0 0 0-8c-2 0-4 1.33-6 4Z"/>
    </svg>

  {%- comment -%}
    Los dos que siguen entran con la migracion a Horizon (D-081): reemplazan al
    icon-caret y al icono "info" de Material que venian de Shrine. 'caret' es el
    indicador de las preguntas (cauce-faq); gira con el <details> por CSS.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- when 'caret' -%}
    <svg class="cauce-icono {{ cauce_clase }}" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <path d="m6 9.5 6 6 6-6"/>
    </svg>

  {%- when 'info' -%}
    <svg class="cauce-icono {{ cauce_clase }}" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 11v5.5M12 7.8h.01"/>
    </svg>

  {%- comment -%}
    Los dos que siguen son de la garantia del aditivo dental (sections/
    cauce-garantia.liquid). Reemplazan a 'payments' y 'person' de Material.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- when 'pago' -%}
    <svg class="cauce-icono {{ cauce_clase }}" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <rect x="2.5" y="6" width="19" height="12" rx="2"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2.6"/><path d="M6 9.5v5M18 9.5v5"/>
    </svg>

  {%- when 'persona' -%}
    <svg class="cauce-icono {{ cauce_clase }}" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <circle cx="12" cy="8" r="3.8"/><path d="M4.5 20.5c.8-3.9 3.8-6 7.5-6s6.7 2.1 7.5 6"/>
    </svg>

  {%- comment -%}
    Redes del pie (sections/cauce-pie.liquid). Glifos genericos de trazo, del
    mismo set: no son los logos oficiales redibujados.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- when 'instagram' -%}
    <svg class="cauce-icono {{ cauce_clase }}" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <rect x="3.5" y="3.5" width="17" height="17" rx="4.5"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3.8"/><path d="M17 7h.01"/>
